let __v_156 = Value::from("Take paracetamol or ibuprofen, rinse with warm salty water and keep eating on the other side, but book a dentist: a toothache that wakes you or comes with a swollen face needs seeing the same day. Clove oil on the tooth numbs it for a while and is the home remedy worth having - a drop or two on the tooth itself, not swallowed - and do not put aspirin on the gum, it burns it. Do not use the oil on broken skin, in a child's mouth or on a gum that is already sore and bleeding.");
