let __v_303 = Value::from("A reading of 140/90 or higher, seen twice at home, is high and worth a GP check: they will confirm it and talk through treatment. Meanwhile cut salt, keep to 14 units of alcohol a week, and 150 minutes of walking a week lowers it by a few points. 180/120 or higher with a bad headache, chest pain or blurred vision is 999.");
