let __v_331 = Value::from("Not without a doctor: in the UK melatonin is a prescription for children, not something you buy, and it is not licensed for the under-twos. For a child who will not settle, the routine does more than any tablet - the same bedtime every night, a dark room, no screens in the last hour, and a short goodnight - so give that two or three weeks first. If nights are still bad, ask your GP or health visitor about a sleep plan before medicine.");
