let __v_7073 = Value::from("Take it at the same time each day, and for most statins that is the evening: the body makes most of its cholesterol at night, and simvastatin has to be taken in the evening. Atorvastatin and rosuvastatin last long enough to work at any time of day, so if mornings are easier to remember, ask the pharmacist whether yours can move to one.");
