let __v_7074 = Value::from("A statin is usually for the long term, and it is judged on a blood test at about three months rather than on how you feel, so keep taking it and have that test done. Mention muscle aches you cannot explain, and any new stomach upset or rash, instead of stopping it yourself: most people take one for years without trouble, and most of the ones who do get aches are fine on a different statin.");
