let __v_8184 = Value::from("Sit or lie down for a few minutes with your feet up and your head low, loosen anything tight at the neck, and drink a glass of water - most faintness is a moment of low blood pressure or low blood sugar and passes with that. Eat something if it has been hours since you last did, and stand up slowly for the rest of the day. Ring 999 if you actually passed out and hit your head, if it comes with chest pain, a racing heart, breathlessness or a weak arm or drooping face, or if it happened while driving. Get a GP check soon if it keeps happening, if you are pregnant, or if you have been losing weight or bleeding.");
